### Guardar metadatos de imagen nueva (URL ya subida) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageTypeId": 1,
  "imageName": "Vista frontal",
  "imageUrl": "/gps/abc123.jpg",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Actualizar imagen existente (con imageId) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageId": 1,
  "imageTypeId": 1,
  "imageName": "Vista lateral",
  "imageUrl": "/gps/abc123.jpg",
  "isDefault": false
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageName": "Vista frontal",
  "imageUrl": "/gps/abc123.jpg"
}

### UnitId inválido (0) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 0,
  "imageName": "Vista frontal",
  "imageUrl": "/gps/abc123.jpg"
}

### Sin imageUrl (campo requerido faltante) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageName": "Vista frontal"
}

### WD-2050: unidad inexistente o fuera del scope del partner → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 999999999,
  "imageTypeId": 1,
  "imageName": "Vista frontal",
  "imageUrl": "/gps/abc123.jpg",
  "isDefault": false
}

### WD-2050: imageId inexistente para la unidad (antes respondía 200 sin actualizar nada) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/saveUnitImage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "imageId": 999999999,
  "imageTypeId": 1,
  "imageName": "Vista lateral",
  "imageUrl": "/gps/abc123.jpg",
  "isDefault": false
}
